<title>USA: H.E.R.C. Products sees profits late in '97.</title>
<headline>H.E.R.C. Products sees profits late in '97.</headline>
<dateline>PHOENIX, Ariz. 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>H.E.R.C. Products Inc, which Thursday reported a 1996 loss, said it sees decreased operating losses going forward and expects to see profits in &quot;the latter part&quot; of 1997.</p>
<p>The company also said it expects 1997 revenues to improve over the 1996 level of $2.6 million.</p>
</text>
